authors:
  - family-names: "Anandakumar"
    given-names: "Raj"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RajAnandakumar-Microsoft/clean-compute-engine"
abstract: >-
  An independent, pre-calibration research prototype investigating data centers
  and their energy supply as a connected system. The intended world model links
  computing demand, cooling, renewable generation, storage, grid access, and
  permitted workload scheduling to environmental and service trade-offs.
  Current outputs are synthetic scenarios, not validated predictions or
  optimized plans. The project has no organizational sponsor.
